ideogram4/
Boogu-Image/

# Runtime output
output/

# NOTE: `scripts/` was previously ignored here, but 40 files under it are already
# tracked (every deploy/test/benchmark script CLAUDE.md documents). The rule only
# ever blocked NEW tooling from being added — e.g. the NVIDIA driver repair and
# check scripts would have been silently uncommittable. If you want to keep
# generated scripts out of git, ignore them specifically rather than the whole tree.

# Large binaries
*.wav
*.mp3
*.ogg
